 bridgeResult:has('song')?'You sing a song about a banana who became a lawyer. The bridge creaks in protest, then holds very still to listen. While it is distracted, Zip tapes the loose plank and Bloop retrieves the duckling. Teamwork can be deeply embarrassing.':has('duck')?'You help the duck and its duckling back onto firm wood. The bridge settles beneath your careful footsteps. It turns out the trick was not being fearless. It was making sure nobody had to wobble alone.':'Your crew steadies the bridge and guides the duckling to safety. It takes patience, three strips of tape, and a very reassuring blob.',
 duckResult:has('duck')?'“You stopped when you could have hurried,” the duck says. “I won’t forget.”':'“Thank you for the song,” the duck says. “The duckling is already insisting on a sequel.”',
 marketResult:has('ribbon')?'The moth ties your ribbon around the stall’s sign. “Come back after the carnival,” she says. “I’ll have something for your hair.”':'The moth tries your joke on a passing lemon. The lemon does not laugh, but the moth laughs enough for both of them.',
 buddyResult:s.companion==='blob'?'Bloop copies the sentence onto the inside of their cape. “So I can check it when I’m being a disaster,” they explain. You remind them that they rescued a duckling today. Bloop stands a little taller.':'Zip reads the sentence twice, then folds up her BRING A PLAN paper. “Maybe a plan can change,” she says. “That doesn’t mean it wasn’t a plan.” She looks noticeably less worried about the corners.',
