 mapResult:s.items.includes('Duck’s map')?'You recognize the quiet route on the duck’s map. It leads behind the noisy pipes to this sheltered doorway. Rub built a little place to rest even here.':'You follow the pipes around the tower until you find a sheltered doorway. Someone has tucked a small bench beside it, away from the noise.',
